msgid ""
"With Quarkus 2 approaching its imminent release and we passed 50 episodes of Quarkus Insights we want to do\n"
"Q&A episode similar to what we did earlier in the year."
msgstr "Com a proximidade do lançamento iminente do Quarkus 2 e a passagem dos 50 episódios do Quarkus Insights, queremos fazer um episódio de perguntas e respostas semelhante ao que fizemos no início do ano."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"We will cover the most often asked questions we have seen and any question tagged with `#quarkusinsights`\n"
"on our various social media presences: https://twitter.com/search?q=%23quarkusinsights[Twitter], https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/quarkusinsights/[Facebook] or https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/content/?keywords=%23quarkusinsights&origin=GLOBAL_SEARCH_HEADER[LinkedIn]."
msgstr "Cobriremos as perguntas mais frequentes que já vimos e qualquer pergunta marcada com `#quarkusinsights` em nossas várias presenças nas mídias sociais: link:https://twitter.com/search?q=%23quarkusinsights[Twitter] , link:https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/quarkusinsights/[Facebook] ou link:https://www.linkedin.com/search/results/content/?keywords=%23quarkusinsights&origin=GLOBAL_SEARCH_HEADER[LinkedIn] ."

#, fuzzy
msgid "If you have a question about Quarkus you would like answered let us know on one of thoses sites using `quarkusinsights` as a tag."
msgstr "Se tiver uma pergunta sobre o Quarkus que gostaria de ver respondida, informe-nos num destes sítios utilizando `quarkusinsights` como etiqueta."
